WEBVTT

00:28:59.910 --> 00:29:04.726
which means I get on my stationary bike
and listen to a podcast

00:29:04.750 --> 00:29:07.386
in the same way I do when I drive to work

00:29:07.410 --> 00:29:11.086
for roughly 30 minutes
before going to actually sit at my desk.

00:29:11.110 --> 00:29:12.353
Man: To stay productive,

00:29:12.377 --> 00:29:14.535
I could only use my phone
in the living room,

00:29:14.559 --> 00:29:17.486
so pretty much my cell phone
never leaves that area,

00:29:17.510 --> 00:29:20.733
and if I have to pick up a call,
I'll have to go to the living room.

00:29:20.757 --> 00:29:22.100
If I want to check Facebook,

00:29:22.124 --> 00:29:24.505
I have to go to the living room
in order to do so.

00:29:24.529 --> 00:29:28.496
Scott Kelly: I have a little bit of
a mission control setup,

00:29:28.520 --> 00:29:31.736
so I got an iPad, a second iPad.